OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds gather to watch river
OL,4,Afootball match
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people gathered to watch
OL,7,Fthe annual August bank holiday
OL,8,Ftradition of teams playing football
OL,9,Fmatches in a shallow river.
OL,11,FThe River Windrush football match,
OL,12,Fhosted by Bourton Rovers Football Club
OL,13,Fin Bourton-on-the-Water in
OL,14,FGloucestershire, involves players
OL,15,Fcompeting in ankle-deep water.
OL,17,FThose who were brave enough to stand on
OL,18,Fthe edge of the riverbank came equipped
OL,19,Fwith waterproof jackets and umbrellas
OL,20,Fto stay dry while the players contested
OL,21,Fthe game, which finished 3-3.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
