OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds gather to watch river
OL,4,Afootball match
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tradition is said to have started
OL,7,Fmore than 100 years ago when drinkers
OL,8,Fin a riverside pub got bored and
OL,9,Fdecided to stage an impromptu match in
OL,10,Fthe water.
